[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3076580502","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108651#issuecomment-3076580502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108651","id":3076580502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63YOSW","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-16T03:20:53Z","updated_at":"2025-07-16T03:20:53Z","body":"> Maybe we should first check if there are any unsaved scenes (etc.). If there are, we could skip showing `Stop & Quit`. \n\nI don't have a strong preference and the behaviour shown in those videos is acceptable to me.\n\nThat said, I do think there is minor value in doing the action at the time it is requested before moving to the next step. For example, if the user taps \"stop & quit\", I expect the game to be immediately stopped and then the quit should happen, which would prompt to save the scene. If the order was backwards, I would similarly expect that when the \"save\" button is tapped, it would save immediately and then prompt if you want to stop. Does that make sense? (Sorry, that was a bit awkward to write.)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3076580502/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3077909774","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108651#issuecomment-3077909774","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108651","id":3077909774,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63dS0O","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-16T10:17:59Z","updated_at":"2025-07-16T10:17:59Z","body":"I don't think my solution will work properly if multiple scenes are changed. The Stop & Quit confirmation would keep popping up, so I'd have to stop the project before saving.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3077909774/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confuse